I solved the color problem by adding OPTIONS=color to my rc file. I
noticed this in the sample configuration file in the nethack docs dir.
Hopefully, this will help others who were, like me, not paying enough
attention.
>
> Also, again from memory, when the file is copied over to linux it 
> needs to
> be renamed, to (I think) .nethackrc from defaults.nh .

That is correct-- I had done so and everything works as expected, except
colors. This is because, as you said, the Linux version doesn't have
colors turned on by default.
